e about AI in earnings calls. Around a third are directly attributing financial impact to their implementation of AI. And these are not one-offs &#8211; companies that mention AI make an average of 6.8 separate claims, and they put numbers on 5.1 of them.</p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p>See our<a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/"> </a><strong><a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/">State of the AI Economy</a></strong><a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/"> 2026 report</a> for more.</p><p>&#128231; For advisory requests and institutional inquiries, please contact <a href="mailto:aieconomy@exponentialview.co">aieconomy@exponentialview.co</a></p></div><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.exponentialview.co/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.exponentialview.co/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><hr></div><h3><span>Monday signals</span></h3><ol><li><p><strong>Who keeps the skill?</strong> After three months with an AI assistant, senior patent lawyers <span>performed the same task</span><a href="https://www.nber.org/papers/w35720"><span>&nbsp;0.45 standard deviations better than peers</span></a><span>&nbsp;who never used</span> the assistant. Junior lawyers gained the most while using it but showed no lasting gain on average.</p></li></ol><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-rWT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96d19fb2-23c8-4777-a33f-5e7635e205bd_2048x1138.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-rWT!,w_424,