s%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a2caf09-bb24-44e4-8719-3ef8c14b7fb1_1330x817.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZzME!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a2caf09-bb24-44e4-8719-3ef8c14b7fb1_1330x817.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZzME!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a2caf09-bb24-44e4-8719-3ef8c14b7fb1_1330x817.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZzME!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a2caf09-bb24-44e4-8719-3ef8c14b7fb1_1330x817.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p>See our<a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/"> </a><strong><a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/">State of the AI Economy</a></strong><a href="https://intelligence.exponentialview.co/"> 2026 report</a> for more.</p><p>&#128231; For advisory requests and institutional inquiries, please contact <a href="mailto:aieconomy@exponentialview.co">aieconomy@exponentialview.co</a></p><p>&#129309; Want to work with us? We are hiring an <strong><a href="https://www.exponentialview.co/p/ai-economy-research-fellowship-2026">AI Economy Research Fellow</a></strong></p></div><div><hr></div><h2><span>Monday signals</span></h2><ol><li><p><strong><span>AI dents margins. </span></strong><span>Snowflake cut its full-year product gross-margin guidance </span><a href="https://www.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-snowflake-beats-q2-2026-estimates-shares-jump-22-93CH-4886846"><span>from 75% to 74%</span></a><span>, saying that fast-growing AI workloads &#8220;carry a lower contribution margin today&#8221;. Investor Tomasz Tunguz estimates that </span><a href="https://x.com/ttunguz/status/2095637039286981046">AI accounts for ~4-5% of Snowflake's revenue</a><span> today.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>AI gets off the hook.</span></strong><span> AI-attributed US </span><a href="https://www.challengergray.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Challenger-Report-August-2026.pdf">job cuts fell in August</a><span>, ending a five-month run as the most-cited reason for layoffs &#8212; though it still accounts for 22% of the year&#8217;s cuts.</span></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewab