   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[📈 Data to start your week]]></title><description><![CDATA[Nvidia doubles again; AI&#8217;s cover-up habit; the $1.50 data centre bill++]]></description><link>https://www.exponentialview.co/p/data-to-start-your-week-01-09-26</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.exponentialview.co/p/data-to-start-your-week-01-09-26</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Azeem Azhar]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 10:03:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BrCe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e1a5dad-1b45-4aea-b835-b425da0da073_2700x1500.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hi,</p><p><span>Here&#8217;s the latest roundup of our data signals across AI, energy &amp; markets.</span></p><div><hr></div><h3><strong>The state of the AI economy</strong></h3><p><span>Every week, we share the latest updates on the state of the AI economy based on our own latest research and tracking.</span></p><p><span>More models have shipped since we published our </span><a href="https://www.exponentialview.co/p/the-state-of-the-ai-economy"><span>State of the AI Economy report</span></a><span> in June. At the time, we highlighted that a frontier model is a rapidly depreciating asset. This remains true even at the highest GPQA Diamond grades, where the pricing power of a new model quickly vanishes.</span></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BrCe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e1a5dad-1b45-4aea-b835-b425da0da073_2700x1500.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BrCe!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progress